ithout thorough verification.\n\n\n**DO NOT** invest real money based on this demonstration. The simulated environment likely uses simplified assumptions or parameters that do not reflect market realities. The consistent upward trend observed on the dashboard is not a guarantee of future profits in a live trading scenario.\n\n\nThe system is designed to simulate a specific visual outcome, not to reflect real-world trading conditions; synthetic events generate the trades. This simulation uses a biased win rate to create the illusion of rapid gains, which is common in marketing hype. In reality, consistent, effortless profits like this are unsustainable due to market frictions and regime shifts.\n\n\n"}
